cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LabAIAgent in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "LabAIAgent: a universal, safety-gated AI-agent gateway for laboratory instruments"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "BioMedsAI"
version: 1.4.1
date-released: "2026-08-29"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - laboratory automation
  - AI agents
  - large language models
  - self-driving laboratory
  - instrument control
  - audit trail
abstract: >-
  LabAIAgent is a vendor-neutral control, safety, and audit layer that makes
  laboratory instruments discoverable and safely operable by any AI agent
  runtime (MCP, OpenAI/Gemini tool calling, LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI,
  AutoGen, smolagents, REST/OpenAPI) through one fixed fourteen-tool
  interface. Every actuation passes a fail-closed six-layer safety engine
  under a verified per-agent identity and is recorded in a hash-chained,
  optionally HMAC-keyed, tamper-evident audit log.
